; `commodity X` with a `default` sub-directive sets the same default
; commodity as the D directive: it is the -V target (over the later
; CHF price), and `xact` gives it to an amount written without one
; when no earlier transaction supplies a commodity.
commodity $
    format $1,000.00
    default

P 2024/01/01 EUR $2.00
P 2024/01/05 EUR 1.5 CHF

2024/01/03 Euros
    C               10 EUR
    D

test bal -V C --now 2024/02/01
              $20.00  C
end test

test xact --now 2024/02/01 2024/02/01 Shop Food 5 Cash
2024/02/01 Shop
    Food                                       $5.00
    Cash
end test
